data: {"id":"gen-1794250934-Qs1VHDm23D75kiiRDG4E","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794250934,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Assessing Token Injection**\n\nI'm now focusing on the critical failure point: the API token. I've pinpointed a major flaw in dynamic credential handling. The `WebServing_Expert` generates code with a placeholder token, and the system lacks any mechanism, or agent, to obtain and inject the valid token. `Verification_Expert` also fails here. This causes a loop, undermining the system's ability to evolve and adapt.\n\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Assessing Token Injection**\n\nI'm now focusing on the critical failure point: the API token. I've pinpointed a major flaw in dynamic credential handling. The `WebServing_Expert` generates code with a placeholder token, and the system lacks any mechanism, or agent, to obtain and inject the valid token. `Verification_Expert` also fails here. This causes a loop, undermining the system's ability to evolve and adapt.\n\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

