data: {"id":"gen-1794250934-Qs1VHDm23D75kiiRDG4E","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794250934,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Assessing Overall Efficiency**\n\nI'm now evaluating the system's overall efficiency. While the individual agent roles (WebServing, Computer Terminal, Verification Expert) appear reasonable, the critical flaw lies in how they interact regarding dynamic credential handling. Specifically, the system cannot autonomously manage and inject API tokens. The WebServing agent provides an instruction on getting the token but does not perform it, resulting in failed execution, repeated errors, and a looping, non-evolving state.\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Assessing Overall Efficiency**\n\nI'm now evaluating the system's overall efficiency. While the individual agent roles (WebServing, Computer Terminal, Verification Expert) appear reasonable, the critical flaw lies in how they interact regarding dynamic credential handling. Specifically, the system cannot autonomously manage and inject API tokens. The WebServing agent provides an instruction on getting the token but does not perform it, resulting in failed execution, repeated errors, and a looping, non-evolving state.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

